 footer strip: left \"事实来源：测评资料原文 · 不含外部事实\" and right page number \"2 / 6\". Place at y ~ 990.\n\nActually put page number bottom-right at right:96, bottom:48 with big-ish serif? Reference style is small letterspaced. I'll do \"2 / 6\" at 15px letterspaced 3px, muted, with a thin rule above maybe.\n\nLet me also add a vertical rail label on left: \"CUSTOMER PROBLEM · 客户问题\" rotated.\n\nColors: \n--bg #F5F2E9\n--ink #1B2620\n--muted #5C665D\n--olive #4F5E43\n--gold #B4914A\n--blue #8C9FB2\n--line #A3AC9E\n\nLet me write the HTML.\n\nDetail for status chip: small pill with gold border, text \"待补充\".\n\nLeft big panel:\n- top-left small label \"01 / 状态\"\n- big statement: \"资料未提供具体客户问题描述\" 44px, line-height 1.35\n- below: a horizontal divider, then two lines: \"本页不对客户痛点作任何推断或补充。\" 20px muted, and chip 待补充.\n\nHmm, \"本页不对客户痛点作任何推断或补充\" is a process statement, fine (not a fact claim).\n\nAlso add \"→ 请补充访谈或测评问题记录\" in the fourth card.\n\nLet me write.\n\nCSS for register circle top right — replicate simplified.\n\nI'll include background decorative elements but keep code manageable.\n\nWrite now.\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:#F5F2E9;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\n:root{\n --bg:#F5F2E9; --surface:#F3F0E7; --ink:#1B2620; --muted:#5C665D;\n --olive:#4F5E43; --gold:#B4914A; --blue:#8C9FB2; --line:#A3AC9E;\n --serif:'Bodoni Moda',Georgia,'Songti SC','Source Han Serif SC','Noto Serif SC',serif;\n --sans:'Archivo','Helvetica Neue',Arial,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\n}\n.slide{position:relative;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--ink)}\n...\n```\n\nThen elements.\n\nBackground:\n.bg-field absolute inset 0 radial gradients.\n.bg-field:after repeating-linear-gradient vertical lines.\n.gridline gl1..gl3.\n.dot-field dot-top, dot-bottom.\n.edge-prism right si